      "title": "Software libraries",
      "description": "The outside libraries this layer's code imports, one `software-library` node each: the version and sha512 `bun.lock` pins, the registry tarball, the SPDX licence read from the installed package, the range, whether it is a dev dependency, and the files that import it (`usedBy`). GENERATED, never hand-edited: `bun run cat libraries:derive` writes it and `libraries:check` fails on a stale node, an import no node names, or a shim no node names. The kind is this layer's own (`schemas/library/software-library.ts`, bean `jbvi`); each layer keeps its own nodes because it pins its own versions.",
